{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55325","headline":"诗 · 陈抟","name":"诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我见世人忙，个个忙如火。\n忙者不爲身，爲身忙却可。\n（元王恽《秋涧大全集》卷九六《玉堂嘉话》卷四。\n）（按：抟诗今存者尚多，张格《太华希夷志》〖《道藏》本〗存其宋太宗时诗十数首。\n今仅录其作於五代及作年尚难确定者。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈抟","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55325.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55325","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}